{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friend vanished after attending a party at the long-abandoned Blackthorn Manor, and they never made it home. Now, driven by worry and determination, you find yourself standing before the gates of the estate, with nothing but your wits and the faint glow of a lighter to guide you.<br><br> Inside, the manor feels alive with shadows. Every room holds strange puzzles, old secrets, and clues about what really happened the night your friend disappeared. But the deeper you explore, the more  the house is hiding something far darker than you expected. <br><br>Can you explore the haunted halls, solve the puzzles, and uncover the truth about your missing friend? Or will Blackthorn Manor\u2019s secrets trap you forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971370/extras/ba0827ca3c29d0a1d80478c90ede1b75.poster.avif?t=1757149705\" width=1170 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971370/extras/ba0827ca3c29d0a1d80478c90ede1b75.webm?t=1757149705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971370/extras/ba0827ca3c29d0a1d80478c90ede1b75.mp4?t=1757149705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>First-Person Mystery </i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ethereal Mode </i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Challenging Puzzles </i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Creepy Atmosphere </i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Story-Driven</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971370?t=1757149705",